WEBVTT

01:41.000 --> 01:41.620
<b>STRATEGY MEETING</b>

01:41.620 --> 01:44.670
<b>STRATEGY MEETING
Just when we thought damage
to the city would be inevitable</b>

01:44.670 --> 01:45.460
<b>STRATEGY MEETING
a powerful attack pulverized
that giant creature.</b>

01:45.460 --> 01:48.090
<b>a powerful attack pulverized
that giant creature.</b>

01:48.300 --> 01:52.260
<b>So you're saying Centichoro
disappeared without a trace?</b>

01:52.930 --> 01:57.140
<b>It's hard to believe, but this is
a feat only King could pull off.</b>

01:57.350 --> 02:00.180
<b>We are incredibly lucky to
have King as our ally.</b>

02:00.270 --> 02:05.310
<b>As for the Hero Hunter, I hear
Silverfang failed to capture him.</b>

02:05.480 --> 02:07.650
<b>What do you plan to do
about this, Sitch?</b>

02:07.940 --> 02:09.690
<b>If he continues to
hunt heroes like this</b>

02:09.690 --> 02:12.280
<b>the Hero Association
will cease to function.</b>

02:13.240 --> 02:18.080
<b>You must no longer view Garou
as a human, but as a monster.</b>

02:18.330 --> 02:20.200
<b>The next time he appears...</b>

02:20.500 --> 02:22.330
<b>He will be categorized as
threat level Dragon</b>

02:22.330 --> 02:24.620
<b>and an emergency alert
must be issued.</b>

02:25.040 --> 02:27.290
<b>But in reality,
he's still a human, right?</b>

02:27.960 --> 02:29.380
<b>Could any normal person actually</b>

02:29.380 --> 02:31.970
<b>stand up to our Class-S heroes
barehanded?</b>

02:32.090 --> 02:33.420
<b>Just think about it.</b>

02:33.930 --> 02:35.590
<b>Maybe the strategy's the problem?</b>

02:35.890 --> 02:37.180
<b><i>"Our" Class-S heroes?</i></b>

02:37.300 --> 02:38.350
<b><i>Even at this stage</i></b>

02:38.350 --> 02:40.140
<b><i>he is treating this</i>
<i>as some kind of business.</i></b>

02:40.810 --> 02:45.100
<b>It was unexpected that Silverfang
failed to finish off Garou</b>

02:45.100 --> 02:47.730
<b>but he did manage to
leave him severely injured.</b>

02:48.150 --> 02:51.070
<b>At least this means
Garou likely won't bolster</b>

02:51.070 --> 02:52.780
<b>the Monster Association's forces.</b>

02:52.990 --> 02:55.280
<b>If nothing else,
we can count that as a win.</b>

02:55.490 --> 02:57.530
<b>Get Blast over here!
Blast, I say!</b>

02:57.820 --> 03:00.450
<b>He's a top-ranker, but he's
not doing anything at all, is he?</b>

03:00.740 --> 03:03.830
<b>It's impossible
to give Blast orders.</b>

03:04.000 --> 03:08.040
<b>He only operates
as a hero voluntarily.</b>

03:08.710 --> 03:12.420
<b>He refuses to be bound by anyone
and dislikes drawing attention</b>

03:12.420 --> 03:15.050
<b>so even in the registry,
his identity is undisclosed.</b>

03:15.590 --> 03:20.470
<b>But that's because we believe he's
worthy of this special treatment.</b>

03:20.760 --> 03:24.310
<b>However, if humanity really needs help</b>

03:24.310 --> 03:26.190
<b>I'm sure he'll take action.</b>

03:26.270 --> 03:27.850
<b>What do you mean?!</b>

03:28.190 --> 03:32.360
<b>That time is now!
A monster abducted my son!</b>

03:33.030 --> 03:35.400
<b>It's been 24 hours since then.</b>

03:35.450 --> 03:37.700
<b>Why haven't you attacked?</b>

03:37.950 --> 03:40.410
<b>I give you my word.
We will save your son.</b>

03:41.160 --> 03:41.990
<b>And you are...?</b>

03:42.490 --> 03:45.330
<b>I'll be commanding
this rescue operation.</b>

03:45.620 --> 03:47.290
<b>My name is Sekingal.</b>

03:47.920 --> 03:49.630
<b>Pleased to make your acquaintance.</b>

03:50.340 --> 03:51.210
<b>Huh?</b>

03:51.880 --> 03:53.960
<b>What operation?</b>

03:54.260 --> 03:58.300
<b>I'll just sweep in and
take care of things in no time.</b>

03:58.590 --> 04:00.350
<b>Do we know where the hideout is?</b>

04:00.800 --> 04:03.640
<b>Child Emperor is working
at full speed on it right now.</b>

04:04.430 --> 04:09.270
<b>I have surveillance robots probing
Centichoro's underground route.</b>

04:09.690 --> 04:12.940
<b>But the area is huge...
we have three days, right?</b>

04:12.940 --> 04:14.030
<b>We only have two days left.</b>

04:14.360 --> 04:16.440
<b>Ugh...
No sleep for me!</b>

04:16.740 --> 04:20.490
<b>The hideout is somewhere
in City Z's ghost town, right?</b>

04:20.700 --> 04:22.870
<b>KABOOM
Shall I just wipe it out?</b>

04:22.870 --> 04:22.990
<b>KABOOM</b>

04:22.990 --> 04:26.000
<b>KABOOM
We must tread carefully
since there is a hostage.</b>

04:26.330 --> 04:28.580
<b>Sounds like a pain in the neck.</b>

04:28.750 --> 04:31.630
<b>If they hadn't done that
they'd have no chance against me.</b>

04:32.130 --> 04:34.500
<b>The monsters must be afraid of me.</b>

04:34.750 --> 04:36.590
<b>The opponents
are pretty formidable.</b>

04:36.590 --> 04:38.010
<b>Yeah, whatever.</b>

04:38.380 --> 04:42.010
<b>Did you call us here just
to give us that warning?</b>

04:44.600 --> 04:45.560
<b>Actually yesterday...</b>

04:45.770 --> 04:48.310
<b>Drive Knight forcibly continued
the investigation on his own.</b>

04:48.640 --> 04:53.190
<b>He ignored our warnings and
entered the ghost town ahead of us.</b>

04:53.900 --> 04:55.070
<b>Why would he go alone?!</b>

04:55.570 --> 05:00.200
<b>He's never lost a battle,
so he must've been confident.</b>

05:00.700 --> 05:01.910
<b>But since last night</b>

05:01.910 --> 05:04.990
<b>we haven't been able to pick up
a signal from his transmitter.</b>

05:05.830 --> 05:09.620
<b>I think it's safe to assume that
Drive Knight has been defeated.</b>

05:11.290 --> 05:12.830
<b>I don't care either way.</b>

05:12.830 --> 05:15.630
<b>You'd better hurry up and
assemble your team.</b>

05:15.920 --> 05:17.170
<b>Who's left?</b>

05:17.800 --> 05:21.840
<b>The Monster Association gave us
a three-day ultimatum.</b>

05:22.050 --> 05:23.220
<b>We still have time.</b>

05:24.430 --> 05:28.640
<b>As soon as the other heroes
are ready, they will rush over too.</b>

05:30.020 --> 05:32.400
<b>Still on standby?
What's going on?</b>

05:33.060 --> 05:35.190
<b>A child is being held hostage?</b>

05:35.570 --> 05:38.150
<b>You didn't know about that,
Atomic Samurai?</b>

05:38.480 --> 05:40.610
<b>You also reek of blood.</b>

05:41.320 --> 05:44.570
<b>Since yesterday, I've been
scouring mountains and caves</b>

05:44.570 --> 05:49.160
<b>looking for hidden monsters and
slashing 'em up, left, and right.</b>

05:50.000 --> 05:51.830
<b>Unfortunately,
I wasn't able to find</b>

05:51.830 --> 05:53.880
<b>the Monster Association's
hideout though.</b>

05:54.380 --> 05:55.460
<b>Yeah, makes sense.</b>

05:55.670 --> 05:59.130
<b>I hear the Monster Association's
hideout is in the ghost town.</b>

05:59.380 --> 06:01.670
<b>What?!
We know that much?</b>

06:02.260 --> 06:05.680
<b>Well, fighting head-on at
the hideout sounds easy enough.</b>

06:06.350 --> 06:08.640
<b>I suggest we all
get some rest till then.</b>

06:08.770 --> 06:11.100
<b>- Okay.
- I'm going to take a shower.</b>

06:13.020 --> 06:13.850
<b>Oh my!</b>

06:14.560 --> 06:18.020
<b>I heard the assault team would
be made up of an elite few, but...</b>

06:18.520 --> 06:21.440
<b>For some reason, there are
some here who don't fit the bill.</b>

06:21.990 --> 06:23.400
<b>This is not a picnic.</b>

06:23.910 --> 06:28.240
<b>How about we refrain from bringing
our fun friends, Atomic Samurai?</b>

06:29.370 --> 06:31.910
<b>I'd like the small fry to stick
to fighting other small fry.</b>

06:32.250 --> 06:33.210
<b>You got that?</b>

06:33.540 --> 06:35.960
<b>It wouldn't be so bad
if they just die</b>

06:35.960 --> 06:38.420
<b>but what if they're taken as
hostages or used as human shields?</b>

06:38.750 --> 06:40.460
<b>That would be a major hassle.</b>

06:41.050 --> 06:42.630
<b>If that ever happens</b>

06:42.630 --> 06:45.300
<b>can you give them the orders
to commit harakiri?</b>

06:45.430 --> 06:47.300
<b>Hey, take it easy, Mr. Handsome...</b>

06:47.390 --> 06:50.010
<b>Amai Mask, are you on the team?</b>

06:50.520 --> 06:55.690
<b>Of course. Those monsters
interrupted my concert.</b>

06:56.060 --> 07:00.610
<b>I see. My disciples are tough,
you know.</b>

07:00.820 --> 07:04.490
<b>I'll tell them to protect
the pretty boy idol</b>

07:04.490 --> 07:06.700
<b>when he gets in trouble.</b>

07:07.030 --> 07:08.660
<b>So relax.</b>

07:08.990 --> 07:10.200
<b>In trouble?</b>

07:10.700 --> 07:12.160
<b>I can't believe there are people</b>

07:12.160 --> 07:14.750
<b>who still doubt
my combat abilities.</b>

07:15.330 --> 07:18.710
<b>I only stay in Class A because
it's easier to oversee everything.</b>

07:18.710 --> 07:20.670
<b>I can move up to Class S
at any time.</b>

07:21.590 --> 07:23.460
<b>Mm, let's see now.</b>

07:23.880 --> 07:26.220
<b>To put it simply,
so an imbecile can understand...</b>

07:26.760 --> 07:28.220
<b>I'm stronger than you.</b>

07:28.470 --> 07:31.720
<b>Hm? Oh yeah?</b>

07:31.720 --> 07:34.230
<b><i>Master! Keep your cool!</i></b>

07:36.140 --> 07:40.980
<b>Warden, you sure I can just walk
right out the front door?</b>

07:41.230 --> 07:43.900
<b>This is an extra-legal measure.</b>

07:44.280 --> 07:45.450
<b>Let me remind you that</b>

07:45.450 --> 07:49.160
<b>every time you've broken
out of prison to do hero work</b>

07:49.160 --> 07:50.870
<b>that's all been illegal activity.</b>

07:51.910 --> 07:53.740
<b>I don't like how
the Hero Association</b>

07:53.740 --> 07:56.210
<b>gives a guy like you
preferential treatment.</b>

07:56.540 --> 07:58.420
<b>But just this once,
I can't afford to say that.</b>

07:59.710 --> 08:03.550
<b>There was a single cat-like monster</b>

08:03.550 --> 08:06.420
<b>who turned some of the prisoners
into monsters and took them away.</b>

08:06.880 --> 08:10.260
<b>Many officers who fought back
lost their lives.</b>

08:10.640 --> 08:12.760
<b>You're a hero out there,
aren't you?</b>

08:12.930 --> 08:14.720
<b>Isn't that right,
boss of the prisoners?</b>

08:15.430 --> 08:18.020
<b>Get revenge for us!</b>

08:18.850 --> 08:20.060
<b>Leave it to me.</b>

08:20.690 --> 08:24.070
<b>I'll make them pay dearly</b>

08:24.070 --> 08:26.070
<b>for wrecking this place
while I was gone.</b>

08:26.990 --> 08:28.610
<b>Hang on, Boss!</b>

08:29.200 --> 08:31.120
<b>I knitted a sweater for you.</b>

08:31.660 --> 08:32.950
<b>Please wear it if you like.</b>

08:37.120 --> 08:40.000
<b>Thank you.
This will give me courage.</b>

08:42.750 --> 08:43.630
<b>Hey.</b>

08:44.000 --> 08:45.880
<b>You mind leaving the room?</b>

08:46.010 --> 08:47.800
<b>I can't focus with
you all staring at me.</b>

08:50.680 --> 08:51.800
<b>Metal Knight.</b>

08:51.930 --> 08:54.680
<b>I know you're pretending
not to be there. Please answer.</b>

08:55.850 --> 08:56.930
<b><i>What...?</i></b>

08:57.140 --> 09:00.230
<b>I feel like I'm wasting
a lot of time and effort.</b>

09:02.020 --> 09:04.980
<b>I'm sure you've figured out
where the hideout is by now, right?</b>

09:05.150 --> 09:07.740
<b>Please tell me.
We're running out of time.</b>

09:07.820 --> 09:09.650
<b>Are you going to
let the hostage die?</b>

09:10.700 --> 09:14.030
<b><i>By not telling you,</i>
<i>the hostage might die.</i></b>

09:14.200 --> 09:15.540
<b><i>But if I do tell you</i></b>

09:15.540 --> 09:19.120
<b><i>I bring death to not only</i>
<i>the hostage, but to all of you.</i></b>

09:19.370 --> 09:23.420
<b><i>I will make a rational choice</i>
<i>based on justice.</i></b>

09:23.830 --> 09:25.750
<b>There's another option.</b>

09:25.750 --> 09:27.710
<b>You can join the operation.</b>

09:28.340 --> 09:30.680
<b>What are you so afraid of?</b>

09:30.880 --> 09:33.640
<b>What is the state of
your machine body right now?</b>

09:34.100 --> 09:37.520
<b>If it has been destroyed, which
monster did that to you and how?</b>

09:38.980 --> 09:40.890
<b><i>Monster King Orochi.</i></b>

09:41.850 --> 09:43.190
<b><i>It was just one strike.</i></b>

09:43.350 --> 09:45.150
<b><i>The arm I used to</i>
<i>guard myself was destroyed.</i></b>

09:45.150 --> 09:47.360
<b><i>Even the self-destruction device</i>
<i>was disabled.</i></b>

09:48.610 --> 09:51.610
<b><i>It's not the Monster Association</i>
<i>I'm afraid of...</i></b>

09:52.360 --> 09:53.200
<b><i>Evil powers are</i></b>

09:53.200 --> 09:55.580
<b><i>watching for their chance to</i>
<i>take over the world.</i></b>

09:55.990 --> 09:58.240
<b><i>When humanity's defenses</i>
<i>become weak</i></b>

09:58.240 --> 10:00.250
<b><i>they'll strike all at once</i>
<i>to take everything.</i></b>

10:00.660 --> 10:02.370
<b><i>Be careful.</i></b>

10:02.620 --> 10:05.130
<b><i>Don't trust anyone around you.</i></b>

10:05.590 --> 10:08.250
<b><i>If you want to enforce justice</i>
<i>do it alone.</i></b>

10:08.710 --> 10:10.840
<b><i>Build up your strength...</i></b>

10:10.840 --> 10:13.050
<b><i>And save it for the right time,</i>
<i>Child Emperor.</i></b>

10:18.810 --> 10:21.230
<b>The Hero Association is useless.</b>

10:21.430 --> 10:22.520
<b>Listen up, all of you!</b>

10:22.850 --> 10:24.150
<b>Even as I speak</b>

10:24.150 --> 10:26.520
<b>my son is trembling in fear
as he waits for help.</b>

10:26.940 --> 10:29.230
<b>Head over to the abandoned area
of City Z immediately</b>

10:29.360 --> 10:30.940
<b>and find the Monsters' hideout!</b>

10:31.110 --> 10:32.700
<b>And rescue my son!</b>

10:33.110 --> 10:34.910
<b>The battle suits you are wearing</b>

10:34.910 --> 10:37.070
<b>are secret weapons
obtained from special channels.</b>

10:37.490 --> 10:38.950
<b>The performance of these suits</b>

10:38.990 --> 10:41.830
<b>easily surpass the power
of any professional hero.</b>

10:42.040 --> 10:42.330
<b>NARINKI PRIVATE FORCE</b>

10:42.330 --> 10:44.080
<b>NARINKI PRIVATE FORCE
Make full use of your battle suits</b>

10:44.080 --> 10:44.210
<b>NARINKI PRIVATE FORCE</b>

10:44.210 --> 10:46.170
<b>NARINKI PRIVATE FORCE
and exterminate
every single monster you encounter.</b>

10:46.170 --> 10:46.210
<b>and exterminate
every single monster you encounter.</b>

10:46.920 --> 10:48.880
<b>I'll pay whatever you name
for the success fee!</b>

10:49.170 --> 10:50.840
<b>Bring back Waganma alive</b>

10:50.840 --> 10:52.880
<b>and you will live in
luxury for generations to come!</b>

10:53.010 --> 10:53.970
<b>Go!!</b>

10:59.930 --> 11:03.680
<b>I'm pretty sure
it's that small building.</b>

11:04.640 --> 11:05.900
<b>I got you cornered!</b>

11:07.810 --> 11:10.110
<b><i>The Blizzard Bunch</i>
<i>has been wiped out.</i></b>

11:10.400 --> 11:12.610
<b><i>Well, half of it</i>
<i>is my sister's fault.</i></b>

11:13.570 --> 11:14.990
<b><i>This is an emergency.</i></b>

11:15.450 --> 11:17.490
<b><i>I need to use this place</i>
<i>as a branch office</i></b>

11:17.490 --> 11:19.410
<b><i>of the Blizzard Bunch</i>
<i>to hold a meeting.</i></b>

11:20.200 --> 11:21.160
<b>Yes?</b>

11:21.540 --> 11:22.830
<b>Saita...
Wait, who are you?</b>

11:23.370 --> 11:25.410
<b>Oh? A friend?</b>

11:26.000 --> 11:28.380
<b>You have a visitor, Saitama!</b>

11:30.540 --> 11:33.050
<b>Blizzard's here again.</b>

11:33.210 --> 11:35.840
<b>Hey, how come the monster I raised</b>

11:35.930 --> 11:38.180
<b>died right away
with just a single hit of yours?</b>

11:38.550 --> 11:40.350
<b>What do you want, Hellish Blizzard?</b>

11:40.600 --> 11:42.560
<b>Master is not
taking any new disciples.</b>

11:42.680 --> 11:44.180
<b>Sorry, it's so cramped.</b>

11:44.310 --> 11:46.890
<b>Would you hand me that poultice?</b>

11:47.190 --> 11:49.400
<b>Why would wind be earth's weakness?</b>

11:49.520 --> 11:51.980
<b>But I'm at level 27
and you're at level 15, you know.</b>

11:52.230 --> 11:53.650
<b>Even if you're at
the highest level</b>

11:53.730 --> 11:56.280
<b>Old Man Golem can't beat
Meow-Meow types.</b>

11:56.700 --> 11:58.200
<b>It's a weak character
to begin with.</b>

11:58.410 --> 12:00.450
<b>What? You should've
told me that sooner!</b>

12:00.530 --> 12:02.660
<b>- This Armpit character...
- That one's weak too.</b>

12:02.790 --> 12:05.290
<b>Actually, only the cute characters
are strong.</b>

12:05.410 --> 12:07.580
<b>Oh, forget it.
That just ruined it for me.</b>

12:08.080 --> 12:09.380
<b><i>What is going on?</i></b>

12:10.250 --> 12:11.880
<b>Hm? Why are you here?</b>

12:12.000 --> 12:13.210
<b>It's an emergency.</b>

12:13.420 --> 12:15.460
<b>The Blizzard Bunch got wiped out!</b>

12:15.630 --> 12:17.840
<b>The Monster Organization is
extremely dangerous.</b>

12:18.090 --> 12:20.050
<b>This is no time
to be playing games.</b>

12:20.050 --> 12:22.470
<b>Do you have any idea
what's going on right now?</b>

12:23.180 --> 12:24.720
<b>You don't need to yell.</b>

12:25.100 --> 12:28.020
<b>I just got home a while ago and
was taking a short break.</b>

12:28.100 --> 12:29.400
<b>Don't lie down!</b>

12:29.600 --> 12:33.440
<b>Just like Master said, we were
also facing some tough opponents.</b>

12:33.860 --> 12:35.480
<b>Don't think you guys
were the only ones.</b>

12:35.690 --> 12:38.990
<b>Yeah, I can tell
from the way you look.</b>

12:39.780 --> 12:41.700
<b>I know King was here before</b>

12:41.740 --> 12:44.700
<b>but what's Silverfang
doing here now?</b>

12:45.290 --> 12:50.330
<b>I fought alongside them,
so Saitama is letting me rest here.</b>

12:50.620 --> 12:52.290
<b>I got a little carried away</b>

12:52.290 --> 12:54.420
<b>threw my back out,
and now I can't move.</b>

12:54.630 --> 12:56.090
<b>My knees gave out.</b>

12:56.300 --> 12:59.430
<b>Using Fist of Roaring Qi, Rending Air
after so long took its toll.</b>

12:59.970 --> 13:03.010
<b>I see, it must have been
quite a battle.</b>

13:03.510 --> 13:07.180
<b><i>Yet why?</i>
<i>Why is this guy the same as usual?</i></b>

13:07.560 --> 13:09.730
<b>Hey Saitama!
You're acting all cool and calm</b>

13:09.730 --> 13:11.350
<b>but you're actually panicking, right?</b>

13:11.400 --> 13:13.270
<b>Not really...
it's just the same as usual.</b>

13:13.610 --> 13:14.440
<b>What?</b>

13:14.480 --> 13:16.820
<b>There's no way this situation
is the same as usual!</b>

13:17.320 --> 13:18.940
<b>Why is she getting mad?</b>

13:19.400 --> 13:21.070
<b>I hate to break it to you</b>

13:21.070 --> 13:23.070
<b>but this situation
is not the same as usual.</b>

13:23.490 --> 13:24.370
<b>BAM BAM
Come sit!</b>

13:24.370 --> 13:24.780
<b>Come sit!</b>

13:25.160 --> 13:26.450
<b>We're going to have
a strategy meeting right now!</b>

13:26.450 --> 13:27.540
<b>BAM BAM
We're going to have
a strategy meeting right now!</b>

13:27.580 --> 13:28.870
<b>Seriously, why are you here?</b>

13:29.210 --> 13:31.620
<b>Genos! You're Class S.</b>

13:31.790 --> 13:34.960
<b>The Hero Association executives
haven't told you about their next moves?</b>

13:37.090 --> 13:38.880
<b>I was supporting
Master Saitama yesterday</b>

13:38.880 --> 13:42.050
<b>at a martial arts tournament
and also in a battle myself.</b>

13:42.510 --> 13:44.550
<b>Not to mention,
the transmitter for the Association</b>

13:44.550 --> 13:46.260
<b>got melted and was destroyed.</b>

13:46.350 --> 13:49.430
<b>I dropped mine
into a crack in the ground.</b>

13:49.680 --> 13:51.770
<b>I noticed mine was broken too.</b>

13:51.850 --> 13:54.440
<b>It might have been because of the
shockwaves from Saitama's punch.</b>

13:54.690 --> 13:56.230
<b>So what's our next move?</b>

13:56.270 --> 13:58.730
<b>We're on the brink of war
with the monsters.</b>

13:59.030 --> 14:00.990
<b>I need to undergo
some repairs first.</b>

14:01.200 --> 14:03.070
<b>Well, obviously.</b>

14:03.320 --> 14:04.870
<b>We're gonna need time to recover</b>

14:04.870 --> 14:07.280
<b>before we can
get back into action again.</b>

14:07.370 --> 14:08.870
<b>You can't beat age.</b>

14:09.450 --> 14:10.290
<b>What about you, King?</b>

14:10.290 --> 14:13.120
<b>I think there's some other business
I have to tend to...</b>

14:13.540 --> 14:16.500
<b>So Saitama and I are the only ones
who are ready to go.</b>

14:17.290 --> 14:18.590
<b>So what do you say?</b>

14:18.840 --> 14:21.010
<b>Headquarters probably
has its own special task force</b>

14:21.010 --> 14:22.800
<b>that's devising a plan.</b>

14:23.340 --> 14:26.720
<b>But at times like this, actions
taken by Class-B heroes and below</b>

14:26.720 --> 14:28.890
<b>can affect their future evaluation.</b>

14:29.220 --> 14:31.310
<b>So we should try to
do something to contribute.</b>

14:31.390 --> 14:31.850
<b>DAZE</b>

14:31.850 --> 14:32.810
<b>DAZE
Are you listening?</b>

14:33.520 --> 14:34.850
<b>This time, the enemy is</b>

14:34.850 --> 14:37.230
<b>a large group of monsters
that usually act independently</b>

14:37.230 --> 14:39.690
<b>but they have formed an alliance
which is unusual.</b>

14:40.570 --> 14:43.570
<b>However, their organizational structure</b>

14:43.570 --> 14:46.030
<b>likely is more about domination
than cooperation</b>

14:46.030 --> 14:48.330
<b>with a boss giving orders.</b>

14:48.580 --> 14:51.120
<b>Right, a monster group.</b>

14:51.580 --> 14:55.170
<b>If Garou's joined up with them,
that's gonna be trouble.</b>

14:55.330 --> 15:00.000
<b>Yeah, we may never get another
chance to fight Garou alone.</b>

15:00.170 --> 15:01.760
<b>If they still have any monsters</b>

15:01.760 --> 15:04.510
<b>as strong as that centipede
on their side</b>

15:04.510 --> 15:05.470
<b>it's not looking good.</b>

15:05.590 --> 15:07.890
<b>Might as well quit
being a hero, Bang.</b>

15:08.220 --> 15:09.180
<b>Saitama.</b>

15:09.430 --> 15:11.720
<b>Looks like the Hero Hunter
you've been wanting to meet</b>

15:11.720 --> 15:12.810
<b>was at that scene.</b>

15:12.980 --> 15:14.730
<b>You just missed him.</b>

15:15.190 --> 15:19.020
<b>On my way home, I heard that
he hunted down more heroes.</b>

15:21.400 --> 15:22.400
<b>That's unforgivable.</b>

15:22.650 --> 15:25.280
<b>Especially since
he hasn't come for me yet.</b>

15:25.450 --> 15:26.820
<b>Is it because I'm the Caped Baldy?</b>

15:28.240 --> 15:29.830
<b>- Saitama?
- Master?</b>

15:29.950 --> 15:31.040
<b>I'm going out for a bit.</b>

15:31.950 --> 15:33.660
<b>Do you know where Garou is?</b>

15:34.040 --> 15:35.160
<b>I'm gonna look for him.</b>

15:36.040 --> 15:38.580
<b>When I find Garou, I'll punch him.</b>

15:40.210 --> 15:41.920
<b>I'll also buy
napa cabbage on the way back.</b>

15:45.720 --> 15:48.890
<b><i>Here I was calling the shots,</i>
<i>but I'm left out in the cold again...</i></b>

15:49.470 --> 15:51.510
<b><i>Trying to get Saitama</i>
<i>and his crew</i></b>

15:51.510 --> 15:53.470
<b><i>to join the Blizzard Bunch</i>
<i>will not be easy.</i></b>

16:06.570 --> 16:09.570
<b><i>Where am I?</i>
<i>Did I survive?</i></b>

16:09.820 --> 16:11.280
<b><i>My memory is a bit fuzzy.</i></b>

16:12.490 --> 16:14.540
<b><i>Welcome to the Monster Association.</i></b>

16:14.910 --> 16:18.870
<b><i>The fact that you are reading this</i>
<i>means you survived.</i></b>

16:19.500 --> 16:23.300
<b><i>Be aware that we are the ones</i>
<i>who saved your life.</i></b>

16:23.500 --> 16:27.300
<b><i>So wait quietly in this room</i>
<i>without causing any trouble.</i></b>

16:27.630 --> 16:30.840
<b><i>Going outside right now will only</i>
<i>make you a target for heroes.</i></b>

16:31.140 --> 16:32.970
<b><i>What you need is a place to belong.</i></b>

16:33.140 --> 16:36.270
<b><i>There's a change of clothes.</i>
<i>Please feel free to use them.</i></b>

16:38.270 --> 16:42.150
<b><i>Oww... It hurts like hell!!</i>
<i>My whole body!</i></b>

16:42.650 --> 16:45.780
<b><i>I'm thirsty. And I need food...</i></b>

16:45.780 --> 16:47.740
<b><i>...to replenish my blood.</i></b>

16:50.740 --> 16:55.370
<b><i>I was fighting the old man,</i>
<i>then that bird guy appeared...</i></b>

16:55.830 --> 16:58.210
<b><i>The Monster Association...</i>
<i>They get on my nerves.</i></b>

16:59.040 --> 17:00.370
<b><i>What happened to the old man?</i></b>

17:00.750 --> 17:02.330
<b><i>He was fighting that centipede...</i></b>

17:03.250 --> 17:04.340
<b><i>Oh well, who cares...</i></b>

17:05.090 --> 17:08.090
<b><i>The smell of blood permeates</i>
<i>the stagnant air.</i></b>

17:08.470 --> 17:09.430
<b><i>Makes me wanna puke.</i></b>

17:09.880 --> 17:12.430
<b><i>And it's so quiet,</i>
<i>my ears are ringing.</i></b>

17:12.720 --> 17:14.560
<b><i>Am I deep underground?</i></b>

17:14.560 --> 17:15.640
<b><i>Who cares...</i></b>

17:18.850 --> 17:21.270
<b>Please have mercy!
We were wrong!</b>

17:21.310 --> 17:23.730
<b>We'll never defy you ever again!</b>

17:23.860 --> 17:26.150
<b>Noo, I don't want to die!</b>

17:26.230 --> 17:30.610
<b>But you took out
two of my soldiers.</b>

17:30.700 --> 17:33.280
<b>I can't just let you
walk out of here.</b>

17:33.700 --> 17:37.450
<b>Your employer equipped you
with powerful gear</b>

17:37.450 --> 17:39.250
<b>so you'd better fight till the end.</b>

17:39.540 --> 17:44.380
<b>Everyone here just loves turning anyone
who resists into a plaything.</b>

17:44.840 --> 17:47.500
<b>Grr...
It's all his fault.</b>

17:47.760 --> 17:50.670
<b>Dammit. If that freak robot
hadn't shown up</b>

17:50.670 --> 17:52.380
<b>we could've escaped to the surface.</b>

17:52.630 --> 17:54.550
<b>Looks like the advertising worked.</b>

17:54.800 --> 17:56.390
<b>Thanks for the gift.</b>

17:56.510 --> 17:59.520
<b>I'm glad a capable
new recruit came to us.</b>

17:59.600 --> 18:01.390
<b>You pass with flying colors.</b>

18:01.560 --> 18:03.940
<b>What is your name, newbie?</b>

18:04.440 --> 18:06.230
<b>I am Machine God G5.</b>

18:06.230 --> 18:06.650
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
MACHINE GOD G5</b>

18:06.650 --> 18:10.740
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
MACHINE GOD G5
I was deployed by the organization
to aid the Monster Association.</b>

18:10.940 --> 18:12.070
<b>"Organization"?</b>

18:12.280 --> 18:14.990
<b>How did you get to this hideout
without getting lost?</b>

18:15.070 --> 18:16.740
<b>Can I talk to your creator?</b>

18:17.950 --> 18:19.830
<b>So be it.
In any case, we welcome you.</b>

18:19.870 --> 18:21.460
<b>Besides,
we have another arrival anyway.</b>

18:21.830 --> 18:24.960
<b><i>Stay hidden</i>
<i>and wait a little longer, Garou.</i></b>

18:25.790 --> 18:29.000
<b><i>A voice directly in my head!</i>
<i>Is it telepathy?</i></b>

18:29.130 --> 18:32.800
<b>Having fought them myself,
I can say that</b>

18:32.800 --> 18:36.180
<b>their battle suits have
extremely high combat capabilities</b>

18:36.180 --> 18:37.720
<b>and are highly valuable.</b>

18:38.310 --> 18:41.310
<b>However, they appear to be
customized for each individual.</b>

18:41.520 --> 18:45.440
<b>So no one else, let alone a monster,
would be able to use them.</b>

18:45.850 --> 18:49.610
<b>In other words, we should let them
live and use them as pawns.</b>

18:51.190 --> 18:54.860
<b>Then, you're mine.
I'll train you well.</b>

18:56.450 --> 18:57.910
<b>Train?
What on earth?</b>

18:57.990 --> 18:59.450
<b>Please just let us go!</b>

19:00.160 --> 19:01.200
<b>Quiet!</b>

19:07.460 --> 19:13.130
<b>Excellent! I'm lucky to
have such promising slaves!</b>

19:23.430 --> 19:26.060
<b>Hey, Garou. You're up early.</b>

19:26.060 --> 19:27.940
<b>- So that's the Hero Hunter.
- He got rescued...</b>

19:27.940 --> 19:29.820
<b>- I like him.
- ...and treated for his injuries.</b>

19:29.820 --> 19:32.820
<b>Why did Gyoro-Gyoro
take interest in a mere human?</b>

19:32.900 --> 19:35.070
<b>- Is he human? A monster?
- Silence!</b>

19:35.450 --> 19:37.700
<b>I'm going to have an important talk
with him now.</b>

19:38.200 --> 19:40.410
<b><i>What the heck is that giant</i>
<i>in the back?</i></b>

19:41.290 --> 19:42.870
<b>What do you want me to do?</b>

19:43.200 --> 19:47.080
<b>After the recent battle,
there are fewer than 30 remaining</b>

19:47.080 --> 19:49.750
<b>threat-level Demon or higher
monsters left.</b>

19:50.250 --> 19:53.010
<b>Even so,
we are still strong enough to win.</b>

19:53.380 --> 19:57.890
<b>But what we lack right now
is unity...and a leader.</b>

19:58.470 --> 20:02.220
<b>I'd like you to become a member
of the leadership and assist me.</b>

20:02.720 --> 20:04.220
<b>A leader already?</b>

20:04.350 --> 20:05.640
<b>That's a pretty sweet deal.</b>

20:06.100 --> 20:07.520
<b>I was looking for someone</b>

20:07.520 --> 20:12.150
<b>with a strong anti-hero ideology
like him.</b>

20:12.570 --> 20:15.740
<b>He's a lone wolf,
but even if he is battered</b>

20:15.740 --> 20:18.860
<b>the way he goes for the jugular
against Class-S heroes</b>

20:18.860 --> 20:20.070
<b>is truly praiseworthy.</b>

20:21.410 --> 20:24.830
<b>However, our boss, Lord Orochi,
has one condition.</b>

20:25.370 --> 20:29.040
<b>Prove that you are a true monster.</b>

20:29.210 --> 20:30.750
<b>You want me to grow a horn?</b>

20:30.830 --> 20:32.380
<b>You have one day.</b>

20:32.670 --> 20:35.880
<b>I don't care who it is.
Bring me the head of a hero.</b>

20:36.470 --> 20:37.880
<b>If it's a hero's life you want...</b>

20:38.090 --> 20:39.760
<b>Hate to give you the bad news</b>

20:39.760 --> 20:42.140
<b>but Silverfang and his buddies
are alive.</b>

20:42.260 --> 20:44.180
<b>Centichoro was defeated.</b>

20:48.600 --> 20:52.310
<b>Sorry to bother you.
I have a favor to ask you.</b>

20:52.480 --> 20:53.190
<b>Hmph, what do you want?</b>

20:53.190 --> 20:54.570
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
INSECT GOD
Hmph, what do you want?</b>

20:54.730 --> 20:55.360
<b>I want so badly to hear
a human scream.</b>

20:55.360 --> 20:56.940
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
KING THE RIPPER
I want so badly to hear
a human scream.</b>

20:56.940 --> 20:57.070
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
KING THE RIPPER</b>

20:57.070 --> 21:00.320
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
KING THE RIPPER
I'm about to lose my mind.
Hurry up.</b>

21:00.700 --> 21:02.490
<b>Garou went outside.</b>

21:03.490 --> 21:04.660
<b>Follow him.</b>

22:36.960 --> 22:38.710
<b>Yesterday, it was Goketsu.</b>

22:38.710 --> 22:41.210
<b>And today, Centichoro was defeated.</b>

22:41.420 --> 22:44.550
<b>Yeah, I bet even Gyoro-Gyoro
didn't expect two top monsters</b>

22:44.550 --> 22:46.550
<b>to go down
before the decisive battle.</b>

22:46.680 --> 22:49.060
<b>Is that why he's trying to recruit
the Hero Hunter?</b>

22:49.060 --> 22:50.680
<b>So he can be
one of the key warriors?</b>

22:50.890 --> 22:53.020
<b>I can't read Gyoro-Gyoro.</b>

22:53.190 --> 22:55.270
<b>Not like I'm interested
or anything.</b>

22:55.600 --> 22:57.770
<b>As long as I can destroy
the Hero Association and Flash</b>

22:57.770 --> 22:58.610
<b>I'm all good.</b>

22:59.150 --> 23:00.150
<b>We recruited</b>

23:00.150 --> 23:02.400
<b>Speed-o'-Sound Sonic
but what happened to him?</b>

23:02.740 --> 23:04.030
<b>I haven't seen him around.</b>

23:04.240 --> 23:06.450
<b>Maybe he couldn't adapt
to the monster cells.</b>

23:10.740 --> 23:14.500
<b>I suffered all night,
but I think the worst is over.</b>

23:15.040 --> 23:17.210
<b>I hate those bastards from
the Monster Association.</b>

23:17.210 --> 23:19.540
<b>No one told me my stomach
would get this upset.</b>

23:19.710 --> 23:21.130
<b>I'll pay 'em back for this one day.</b>

23:23.300 --> 23:24.260
<b>Whatever.</b>

23:24.630 --> 23:27.550
<b>I never had any intention of
teaming up with the monsters.</b>

23:27.590 --> 23:30.140
<b>I just wanted to
take advantage of them.</b>

23:30.180 --> 23:32.810
<b>My only target is Saitama.</b>

23:33.230 --> 23:34.390
<b>That being said...</b>

23:34.390 --> 23:36.940
<b>I can feel it...a new power.</b>

23:37.520 --> 23:40.230
<b>My body is definitely changing.</b>

23:40.610 --> 23:42.480
<b>My body feels light.</b>

23:42.570 --> 23:45.110
<b>It may take a while
to get used to it.</b>

23:45.570 --> 23:47.200
<b><i>So this is monsterization?</i></b>

23:47.320 --> 23:49.910
<b><i>Not that it's anything special.</i></b>

23:50.910 --> 23:55.910
<b>SONIC LOST TWO KILOGRAMS</b>

23:55.910 --> 24:00.770
<b>MONSTER TRAITS</b>
